{"id":"c9e7ac8b29af6dc7","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-slow-growing-arithmetic-homomorphism.md","title":"慢增长算术同态","display":"thm-slow-growing-arithmetic-homomorphism — 慢增长算术同态","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-slow-growing-arithmetic-homomorphism","aliases":["72-thm-slow-growing-arithmetic-homomorphism"],"display":"thm-slow-growing-arithmetic-homomorphism — 慢增长算术同态","chapter":"III","depends_on":["[[72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy]]","[[72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic]]","[[72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III §2.11(1–3); Def.2.16(1); print156–157; PDF168–169","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_status":"checked","source_proof_status":"checked","proof_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-slow-growing-arithmetic-homomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-slow-growing-arithmetic-homomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-slow-growing-arithmetic-homomorphism — 慢增长算术同态"},{"key":"chapter","html":"III"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e7432b8a48a477c7\" href=\"?note=e7432b8a48a477c7\" title=\"72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy\">72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ee59458b6acb7c90\" href=\"?note=ee59458b6acb7c90\" title=\"72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic\">72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3f09cae20e23b713\" href=\"?note=3f09cae20e23b713\" title=\"72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain\">72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III §2.11(1–3); Def.2.16(1); print156–157; PDF168–169"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e7432b8a48a477c7\" href=\"?note=e7432b8a48a477c7\" title=\"72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy\">72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\oplus,\\otimes,\\operatorname{Pow}\">\\(\\oplus,\\otimes,\\operatorname{Pow}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ee59458b6acb7c90\" href=\"?note=ee59458b6acb7c90\" title=\"72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic\">72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha[n]\">\\(\\alpha[n]\\)</span> 及有限链性质见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3f09cae20e23b713\" href=\"?note=3f09cae20e23b713\" title=\"72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain\">72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\Omega\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\Omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；右侧加法、乘法、幂为自然数运算，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0^0=1\">\\(0^0=1\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G_\\alpha(n)=|\\alpha[n]|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G_\\alpha(n)=|\\alpha[n]|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G_{\\alpha\\oplus\\beta}(n)=G_\\alpha(n)+G_\\beta(n),\\qquad G_{\\alpha\\otimes\\beta}(n)=G_\\alpha(n)\\cdot G_\\beta(n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G_{\\alpha\\oplus\\beta}(n)=G_\\alpha(n)+G_\\beta(n),\\qquad G_{\\alpha\\otimes\\beta}(n)=G_\\alpha(n)\\cdot G_\\beta(n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G_{\\operatorname{Pow}(\\alpha,\\beta)}(n)=G_\\alpha(n)^{G_\\beta(n)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G_{\\operatorname{Pow}(\\alpha,\\beta)}(n)=G_\\alpha(n)^{G_\\beta(n)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>§2.11 把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_n\">\\(G_n\\)</span> 视为把树序数算术映到自然数算术的同态，印刷 p.156 / PDF p.168；第一式同时连接该节的基数定义与 Definition 2.16(1)，印刷 p.157 / PDF p.169。已核对原书的三项算术等式及递归论证；下列是完整的局部归纳。</p>\n<p>基数等式按树归纳：零的前驱集为空；后继时新元素 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha[n]\">\\(\\alpha[n]\\)</span> 中，基数恰加一；极限时前驱集与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 都选第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个子树。</p>\n<p>加法等式按右参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 归纳。零分支两侧都是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_\\alpha(n)\">\\(G_\\alpha(n)\\)</span>；后继分支两侧都在归纳等式上加一；极限分支的左右两侧分别归约到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_n\">\\(\\beta_n\\)</span>，由归纳假设相等。乘法等式也对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 归纳；零分支为零，后继分支用已证加法等式变为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_\\alpha(n)G_\\beta(n)+G_\\alpha(n)\">\\(G_\\alpha(n)G_\\beta(n)+G_\\alpha(n)\\)</span>，极限分支归约到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_n\">\\(\\beta_n\\)</span>。幂等式最后归纳：零分支为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_{\\overline1}(n)=1\">\\(G_{\\overline1}(n)=1\\)</span>，后继分支用已证乘法等式乘上 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_\\alpha(n)\">\\(G_\\alpha(n)\\)</span>，极限分支归约到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_n\">\\(\\beta_n\\)</span>。即使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_\\alpha(n)=G_\\beta(n)=0\">\\(G_\\alpha(n)=G_\\beta(n)=0\\)</span>，零指数分支仍与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0^0=1\">\\(0^0=1\\)</span> 相容。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"e7432b8a48a477c7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"ee59458b6acb7c90","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain","status":"resolved","id":"3f09cae20e23b713","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"e7432b8a48a477c7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G$ 见 [[72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy]]；$\\oplus,\\otimes,\\operatorname{Pow}$ 见 [[72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic]]；$\\alpha[n]$ 及有限链性质见 [[72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"ee59458b6acb7c90","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G$ 见 [[72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy]]；$\\oplus,\\otimes,\\operatorname{Pow}$ 见 [[72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic]]；$\\alpha[n]$ 及有限链性质见 [[72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain","status":"resolved","id":"3f09cae20e23b713","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G$ 见 [[72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy]]；$\\oplus,\\otimes,\\operatorname{Pow}$ 见 [[72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic]]；$\\alpha[n]$ 及有限链性质见 [[72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\oplus,\\otimes,\\operatorname{Pow}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"0^0=1","display":false},{"tex":"G_\\alpha(n)=|\\alpha[n]|.","display":true},{"tex":"G_{\\alpha\\oplus\\beta}(n)=G_\\alpha(n)+G_\\beta(n),\\qquad G_{\\alpha\\otimes\\beta}(n)=G_\\alpha(n)\\cdot G_\\beta(n).","display":true},{"tex":"G_{\\operatorname{Pow}(\\alpha,\\beta)}(n)=G_\\alpha(n)^{G_\\beta(n)}.","display":true},{"tex":"G_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha[n]","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"G_\\alpha(n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"G_\\alpha(n)G_\\beta(n)+G_\\alpha(n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_n","display":false},{"tex":"G_{\\overline1}(n)=1","display":false},{"tex":"G_\\alpha(n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_n","display":false},{"tex":"G_\\alpha(n)=G_\\beta(n)=0","display":false},{"tex":"0^0=1","display":false}],"bytes":2442,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-138","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-slow-growing-arithmetic-homomorphism|thm-slow-growing-arithmetic-homomorphism — 慢增长算术同态]]"},{"id":"e7432b8a48a477c7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"来源：第 III 章 §2.11 和 Definition 2.16(1)，印刷 pp.156–157 / PDF pp.168–169。每个递归调用严格下降到子树，输出属于自然数，故由良基递归得到唯一全函数。没有假定层次只依赖外延序数；基本序列属于输入。由前驱集递归还可归纳得到 $G_\\alpha(n)=|\\alpha[n]|$；本次已对 PDF pp.168–169 的定义复核。该等式现由 [[72-thm-slow-growing-arithmetic-homomorphism]] 单独陈述并给出完整归纳证明。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-138","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-slow-growing-arithmetic-homomorphism|thm-slow-growing-arithmetic-homomorphism — 慢增长算术同态]]"},{"id":"8d01f06a62827a91","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Omega_s,\\prec,\\alpha[n]$ 及递增穷尽见 [[72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion]]；$G_\\alpha(n)=|\\alpha[n]|$ 与有限树序数 $\\overline k$ 见 [[72-thm-slow-growing-arithmetic-homomorphism]]；$H,B,F$ 及有限迭代见 [[72-df-hardy-hierarchy]]、[[72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy]]。"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-332","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-slow-growing-arithmetic-homomorphism|72-thm-slow-growing-arithmetic-homomorphism]]"}],"outgoing":["e7432b8a48a477c7","ee59458b6acb7c90","3f09cae20e23b713"]}